# Negative concurrency canary (reviewer item 35 — test c): the INOUT
# ACROSS AWAIT rejection — a mutating closure passed across an
# async-marked boundary (spawn/schedule/poll/async — the await boundary)
# cannot carry the lexical inout state.
use std::core

def schedule_tasks(f: fn(Int) -> Unit) -> Unit
  f(0)
end

def main() -> Int
  mut x = 0
  schedule_tasks(do |_|
    x = x + 1
  end)
  0
end
